{"id":"481115505a33e900","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-fun-countable-support-function.md","title":"ZFC Fun Countable Support Function","display":"df-zfc-fun-countable-support-function — ZFC Fun Countable Support Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-fun-countable-support-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-fun-countable-support-function"],"display":"df-zfc-fun-countable-support-function — ZFC Fun Countable Support Function","depends_on":["[[58-df-countable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-fun-countable-support-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-fun-countable-support-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-fun-countable-support-function — ZFC Fun Countable Support Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"58-df-countable\">58-df-countable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,X,Y,0_Y\\in V\">\\(f,X,Y,0_Y\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_Y\\in Y\">\\(0_Y\\in Y\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"58-df-countable\">58-df-countable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFunCountableSupportFunction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFunCountableSupportFunction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFunCountableSupportFunction}_S(f,X,Y,0_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n0_Y\\in Y\\land f\\in Y^X\\land\n\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\{x\\in X\\mid f(x)\\neq0_Y\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFunCountableSupportFunction}_S(f,X,Y,0_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n0_Y\\in Y\\land f\\in Y^X\\land\n\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\{x\\in X\\mid f(x)\\neq0_Y\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The domain, codomain, and distinguished zero are part of the definition rather than implicit ambient data.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-countable","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-countable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-countable","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-countable]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,X,Y,0_Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"0_Y\\in Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFunCountableSupportFunction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFunCountableSupportFunction}_S(f,X,Y,0_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n0_Y\\in Y\\land f\\in Y^X\\land\n\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\{x\\in X\\mid f(x)\\neq0_Y\\})","display":true}],"bytes":934,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-fun-countable-support-function.md|58-df-zfc-fun-countable-support-function]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["1b3610e6aed65b25"]}